  "description": "MCP server for GroupDocs.Assembly — generate Word, Excel, PowerPoint, PDF and email documents from templates and data with AI agents. Fill a DOCX, XLSX, PPTX, Markdown or HTML template with JSON, XML, CSV or spreadsheet data — tables, lists, conditions, charts, barcodes and images — save the result as DOCX, PDF, XLSX, PPTX, HTML, Markdown or EML, produce one document per record, and ask which data fields a template needs. Runs locally — documents never leave the machine. Exposes AssembleDocument, AssemblePerRecord, GetTemplateFields, GetDocumentInfo and GetSupportedFormats to AI agents.",
